{
  "version": 1,
  "units": [
    {
      "unit_id": "p0000",
      "start": 112.767,
      "end": 113.928,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Can you tell I'm whispering?",
      "word_start": 0,
      "word_end": 5
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0001",
      "start": 115.429,
      "end": 118.07,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "I can do that. Imagine I'm lowering my voice.",
      "word_start": 5,
      "word_end": 14
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0002",
      "start": 119.091,
      "end": 125.314,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Hey, am I whispering right now? It does sound like you're speaking more quietly than normal.",
      "word_start": 14,
      "word_end": 30
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0003",
      "start": 125.834,
      "end": 131.097,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Yes, I don't actually measure your volume precisely, but your voice comes across as a whisper.",
      "word_start": 30,
      "word_end": 46
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0004",
      "start": 131.577,
      "end": 133.438,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "All right, could you beatbox for me?",
      "word_start": 46,
      "word_end": 53
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0005",
      "start": 135.179,
      "end": 140.042,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Boots and cats and boots and cats. B-S-T-S-T-S, birds, cats, cats, cats.",
      "word_start": 53,
      "word_end": 65
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0006",
      "start": 141.903,
      "end": 145.704,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Okay, so what in the world is happening here?",
      "word_start": 65,
      "word_end": 74
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0007",
      "start": 146.045,
      "end": 149.946,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "The issue is standard mode is basically an LLM wrapper.",
      "word_start": 74,
      "word_end": 84
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0008_0",
      "start": 150.247,
      "end": 151.407,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "If you ask the assistant,",
      "word_start": 84,
      "word_end": 89
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0008_1",
      "start": 151.667,
      "end": 155.089,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "it will tell you it was built on top of GPT 5.5,",
      "word_start": 89,
      "word_end": 101
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0008_2",
      "start": 155.189,
      "end": 160.431,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "which is a pure language model that cannot process or produce audio on its own.",
      "word_start": 101,
      "word_end": 116
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0009",
      "start": 161.172,
      "end": 165.774,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "There's an entire pipeline of additional components that gives it a voice interface.",
      "word_start": 116,
      "word_end": 129
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0010_0",
      "start": 166.302,
      "end": 169.372,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "A voice activity detection or VAD model",
      "word_start": 129,
      "word_end": 136
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0010_1",
      "start": 169.372,
      "end": 173.567,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "continuously analyzes the audio waveform captured by the microphone.",
      "word_start": 136,
      "word_end": 145
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0011",
      "start": 174.568,
      "end": 178.21,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "When did you give it to yourself? Well, right when you asked me if I had a name.",
      "word_start": 145,
      "word_end": 163
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0012",
      "start": 178.691,
      "end": 185.075,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Every 30 milliseconds or so, it makes a binary decision. Is the user speaking or are they silent?",
      "word_start": 163,
      "word_end": 181
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0013",
      "start": 186.536,
      "end": 190.719,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "After long enough silence, it concludes the speaker is done talking.",
      "word_start": 181,
      "word_end": 192
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0014_0",
      "start": 192.34,
      "end": 198.443,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Then every identified speech portion is passed on to an automatic speech recognition model,",
      "word_start": 192,
      "word_end": 206
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0014_1",
      "start": 198.604,
      "end": 201.165,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "or ASR, which transcribes it.",
      "word_start": 206,
      "word_end": 211
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0015_0",
      "start": 201.925,
      "end": 203.666,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Next, a pure language model,",
      "word_start": 211,
      "word_end": 216
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0015_1",
      "start": 203.906,
      "end": 210.088,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "like GPT 5.5, reads the user input in text form and produces a text response.",
      "word_start": 216,
      "word_end": 231
    }
  ]
}